  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstarfish-studios.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/627986/description_56a0063e-304e-4d5b-9ea9-f846d73ea7ec.png\" alt=\"Starfish Studios 横幅标志\" width=\"520\" height=\"140\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstarfish-studios.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-website-website?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=riseup&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=EB4224&amp;color=EB4224\" alt=\"静态徽章\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshorturl.at%252fagqOV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/StarfishStudios?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=EB4224&amp;color=EB4224\" alt=\"X（原Twitter）关注\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fstarfishstudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/878598895788240936?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=EB4224&amp;color=EB4224\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/610492?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=eb4224&amp;color=eb4224\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></p><div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h3>&nbsp;Dark Fantasy Java 是一款全面的视觉重制版，它以更黑暗、更阴沉、高幻想的美学风格重新诠释了Minecraft。每一处纹理都经过手工精心制作，为你的世界赋予一种阴郁、氛围感十足的风格，同时又不失你熟悉的原版视觉体验。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 这是我们从Minecraft基岩版市场移植的Dark Fantasy 2.0资源包的免费Java版版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>&nbsp; 包含内容：</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; - 方块：完整的一套重新纹理化方块，包括石头、木材、矿石以及装饰性变体，并新增了方块变体，使世界更自然、重复感更少。</p>\n<p><br>&nbsp; - 物品：重新设计的工具、武器、食物等，风格统一以符合黑暗幻想主题。</p>\n<p>- 生物群系：修改了草地、树叶、天空和雾气的颜色，在世界各地营造出独特而阴沉的氛围。</p>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/788/551/polytone_banner2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"164\" height=\"60\"></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>&nbsp; 适用于Minecraft Java版1.21.11。</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp; 只需将其放入资源包文件夹并在游戏中激活即可。</h5>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<p>在此处收听官方DFV原声带 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopen.spotify.com%252falbum%252f0jDCTKgDbRqOHBM8d5XexG%253fsi%253d4AX_eL2LROq6xj5KuwQzOA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a>。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
